Objective: Destroy the ecospheres in the central base in 100 turns

Planet: Frigia
Clan:  Von Griffin

Notes: We have discovered that the drives of our Great Ships have been booby-trapped to explode in response to a subspace pulse that can be sent from a Concord facility on the frozen planet we call Frigia. Apparently the Concord had this set up as a fail safe in case we ever rebelled. The current Concord is so decadent that we are not sure they even realize this possibility exists. But we are so close to freedom that we cannot take the chance.

You are the closest M.A.X. Commander to the scene. Our intelligence shows that they are using Seven Knights fixed defenses and several Concord vehicles to defend the central island, but have no other emplacements. Pick another island, establish yourself, and destroy the enemy base as soon as possible.  We can supply some alien vehicles, but once they are used there will be no more unless you capture some. Good luck.


